  "proof_scope": "Source-reviewed exact publish/hold guards plus routed endpoint inventory. Six decimation metadata bits and address4 trigger-select decode are captured on the same src_capture_o edge as address/data and held until a later accepted request. Address4, address0 arm, address28 average-enable and address30 A-filter-aa consumers explicitly gated by wen in the reviewed source. This classifier only adds the exact reviewed source/sink pairs, not a broad name waiver. Address3C A-PP and address4C B-PP are likewise exact reviewed wen-guarded writes. The remaining exact addressed write fields are individually checked in the common wen block with their actual widths and source addresses; source0 software reset also checked. Arbitrary names and out-of-width endpoints are not accepted. Original v3/v4/v5 FAIL files are retained. Normal consumer cannot act until request traverses two receiver stages. Return is captured with destination ACK/toggle. No timing exception or source modification.",
  "limitations": "16ns is nominal normal minimum of two receiving periods, not a complete physical CDC signoff. Must include actual minimum period/jitter, setup/hold guards, all response-qualified sinks, metastability resolution/MTBF, startup/independent reset/timeout cancellation. Reset CLR and first synchronizer data are separate categories, not 16ns bundles. Existing original classification files are retained.",
